 ],
 "beats": [
  {
   "text": "This is a refrigerator.",
   "startFrame": 10,
   "endFrame": 50
  },
  {
   "text": "Two hundred and twenty litres,",
   "startFrame": 51,
   "endFrame": 89
  },
  {
   "text": "and it does eight kilometres an hour.",
   "startFrame": 90,
   "endFrame": 148
  },
  {
   "text": "Somebody is riding one down",
   "startFrame": 149,
   "endFrame": 179
  },
  {
   "text": "a road in Seoul right now, because legally,",
   "startFrame": 180,
   "endFrame": 235
  },
  {
   "text": "that thing is a moped.",
   "startFrame": 236,
   "endFrame": 266
  },
  {
   "text": "Licence, helmet, all of it.",
   "startFrame": 267,
   "endFrame": 311
  },
  {
   "text": "So who drives a refrigerator to work?",
   "startFrame": 321,
   "endFrame": 386
  },
  {
   "text": "Around eleven thousand people do.",
   "startFrame": 387,
   "endFrame": 436
  },
  {
   "text": "Korea calls them Fresh Managers now,",
   "startFrame": 437,
   "endFrame": 488
  },
  {
   "text": "though everybody still says yogurt lady.",
   "startFrame": 489,
   "endFrame": 546
  },
  {
   "text": "Two of them work",
   "startFrame": 547,
   "endFrame": 569
  },
  {
   "text": "an island in the East Sea.",
   "startFrame": 570,
   "endFrame": 616
  },
  {
   "text": "And the drink they're handing you isn't yogurt.",
   "startFrame": 617,
   "endFrame": 672
  },
  {
   "text": "It pours, because they break the curd on purpose.",
   "startFrame": 673,
   "endFrame": 753
  },
  {
   "text": "Honestly, the whole aisle is like this.",
   "startFrame": 763,
   "endFrame": 808
  },
  {
   "text": "The menu says cider,",
   "startFrame": 809,
   "endFrame": 840
  },
  {
   "text": "so you're expecting apples.",
   "startFrame": 841,
   "endFrame": 873
  },
  {
   "text": "There aren't any.",
   "startFrame": 874,
   "endFrame": 894
  },
  {
   "text": "It's a clear lemon-lime soda,",
   "startFrame": 895,
   "endFrame": 936
  },
  {
   "text": "and it's been on shelves since nineteen fifty.",
   "startFrame": 937,
   "endFrame": 991
  },
  {
   "text": "Sprite didn't exist until nineteen sixty-one.",
   "startFrame": 992,
   "endFrame": 1053
  },
  {
   "text": "So it isn't Korea's version of Sprite.",
   "startFrame": 1054,
   "endFrame": 1105
  },
  {
   "text": "Sprite turned up late.",
   "startFrame": 1106,
   "endFrame": 1149
  },
  {
   "text": "Even the little brown bottle",
   "startFrame": 1157,
   "endFrame": 1190
  },
  {
   "text": "by the till isn't what it looks like.",
   "startFrame": 1191,
   "endFrame": 1244
  },
  {
   "text": "Push past a thousand milligrams of taurine",
   "startFrame": 1245,
   "endFrame": 1304
  },
  {
   "text": "and Korea calls it a drug,",
   "startFrame": 1305,
   "endFrame": 1344
  },
  {
   "text": "so the strong one sits behind a pharmacy counter,",
   "startFrame": 1345,
   "endFrame": 1415
  },
  {
   "text": "and the one you're allowed",
   "startFrame": 1416,
   "endFrame": 1439
  },
  {
   "text": "to buy is the weaker one.",
   "startFrame": 1440,
   "endFrame": 1482
  },
  {
   "text": "None of that is written in English anywhere.",
   "startFrame": 1483,
   "endFrame": 1538
  },
  {
   "text": "So we wrote it down.",
   "startFrame": 1539,
   "endFrame": 1581
  },
  {
   "text": "There's a lot more of this.",
   "startFrame": 1601,
   "endFrame": 1629
  },
  {
   "text": "Every Korean drink worth knowing, on epickor.com.",
   "startFrame": 1633,
   "endFrame": 1709
  }
 ]
}